=== Parse arithmetic operator tokens
+ - * /
---
AdditivePlusOperator          1:1-1:2  0..1  "+"
AdditiveMinusOperator         1:3-1:4  2..3  "-"
FactorMultiplicationOperator  1:5-1:6  4..5  "*"
FactorDivisionOperator        1:7-1:8  6..7  "/"

=== Parse assignment operator tokens
= += -= *= /=
---
SimpleAssignmentOperator           1:1-1:2    0..1    "="
ComplexPlusAssignmentOperator      1:3-1:5    2..4    "+="
ComplexMinusAssignmentOperator     1:6-1:8    5..7    "-="
ComplexMultiplyAssignmentOperator  1:9-1:11   8..10   "*="
ComplexDivideAssignmentOperator    1:12-1:14  11..13  "/="

=== Parse comparison operator tokens
== != > >= < <=
---
EqualOperator                           1:1-1:3    0..2    "=="
NotEqualOperator                        1:4-1:6    3..5    "!="
RelationalGreaterThanOperator           1:7-1:8    6..7    ">"
RelationalGreaterThanOrEqualToOperator  1:9-1:11   8..10   ">="
RelationalLessThanOperator              1:12-1:13  11..12  "<"
RelationalLessThanOrEqualToOperator     1:14-1:16  13..15  "<="

=== Parse logical operator tokens
&& || !
---
LogicalAndOperator  1:1-1:3  0..2  "&&"
LogicalOrOperator   1:4-1:6  3..5  "||"
LogicalNotOperator  1:7-1:8  6..7  "!"
